silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_09_trace_outgoing_profile_sections_02_outgoing_profile_closure_concrete_anchor#mittensdiagramimage a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.06_topology_jepa.chapters.09_trace_outgoing_profile.sections.02_outgoing_profile_closure.concrete_anchor#mittensdiagramimage" .
silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_09_trace_outgoing_profile_sections_02_outgoing_profile_closure_concrete_anchor#mittensdiagramimage silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensDiagramImage is the rendered image of the Mittens olog diagram (head, torso, paws, tail, body-mass 4.2 kg tag, vet-record stamp, Cat-classification arrow) input to the topology-JEPA pipeline. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'I_Mittens', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_09_trace_outgoing_profile_sections_02_outgoing_profile_closure_concrete_anchor#headpatch a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.06_topology_jepa.chapters.09_trace_outgoing_profile.sections.02_outgoing_profile_closure.concrete_anchor#headpatch" .
silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_09_trace_outgoing_profile_sections_02_outgoing_profile_closure_concrete_anchor#headpatch silm:hasLongDescription "The HeadPatch is the rectangular pixel window covering the head region of Mittens-the-cat in the diagram, including the cat-classification node and its outgoing Cat arrow. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'U_head', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
