    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.06_topology_jepa.chapters.09_trace_outgoing_profile.sections.02_outgoing_profile_closure.concrete_anchor#bodypatch" .
silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_09_trace_outgoing_profile_sections_02_outgoing_profile_closure_concrete_anchor#bodypatch silm:hasLongDescription "The BodyPatch is the rectangular pixel window covering the torso of Mittens including the BodyMass 4.2 kg quality node and its measurement arrow. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'U_body', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
