    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.06_topology_jepa.chapters.09_trace_outgoing_profile.sections.02_outgoing_profile_closure.concrete_anchor#tailpatch" .
silm:instances_papers_06_topology_jepa_chapters_09_trace_outgoing_profile_sections_02_outgoing_profile_closure_concrete_anchor#tailpatch silm:hasLongDescription "The TailPatch is the rectangular pixel window covering the tail of Mittens including the 28cm length tag and the white-tuft marking. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'U_tail', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
